OL,3,ADry and chilly start to November after
OL,4,Awet but sunny October
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigh pressure has seized control of the
OL,7,FUK weather meaning largely dry, settled
OL,8,Fbut chilly autumn conditions will
OL,9,Fcontinue this week.
OL,11,FDays will bring a mix of patchy cloud,
OL,12,Fsunny spells and a few showers, with
OL,13,Ffrost and fog expected to form at night
OL,14,F- especially in northern and western
OL,15,Fareas.
OL,17,FTemperatures will generally be around
OL,18,For a little below the seasonal norm and
OL,19,Fit will feel particularly chilly in
OL,20,Fsouthern England and south Wales where
OL,21,Fthere will be a brisk easterly breeze.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
