OL,3,ADry and chilly start to November after
OL,4,Awet but sunny October
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe relatively quiet start to November
OL,7,Ffollows a decidedly mixed October which
OL,8,F- according to Met Office data just
OL,9,Freleased was wetter, warmer and sunnier
OL,10,Fthan average.
